00nF at each of five common VCC contacts.\nC2036/37/38 SIERRA ONLY: DNP in Quectel profiles along with their feed links.\nConfirm effective MLCC capacitance at DC bias and full modem internal capacitance.\nLayout must share current across every populated VCC/GND contact and minimize drop.\nNo released four-module burst specification or temperature/thermal qualification yet." (at 25.4 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "1fc8e799-0ad8-5a9c-941b-8ed439537d80")))
